{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/10f32f6db0a21ffe9c4088b6db6ef2bc.avif?t=1763305184\" width=350 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickman Mayhem is a comic-styled fighting game where chaos rules the streets. With simple controls, flashy moves, and over-the-top action, you\u2019ll crush gangs, face ruthless bosses, and fight your way to become the ultimate stickman brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/5e078700a16c496af12ac5491e3738de.avif?t=1763305184\" width=538 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a splash page of chaos.<strong> Punches crack, kicks smash, and finishers explode off the screen!</strong> Leap into <strong>Beatline</strong>, the climb-to-the-top rank mode where every step puts your skills to the test. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for <strong>Fistfall</strong>, an endless gauntlet of enemies that never stop coming. And when you\u2019re ready for the ultimate challenge, step into <strong>DeathZone</strong>, the brutal boss rush where you\u2019ll face back-to-back masters with no rest and no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/55288ae576cbf0a5cbb91895377d67d5.avif?t=1763305184\" width=538 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is packed with <strong>cinematic finishers</strong>, flashy counters, and that one sweet moment when your enemy falls in slow motion. Easy to pick up, tough to master and just the way a brawler should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/9c9b8c5f7fbb827fbd7d03a5347641dd.avif?t=1763305184\" width=480 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickman Mayhem takes classic stickman action and cranks it to comic-book levels of madness. The streets are loud, the hits are heavy, and the mayhem never ends. Whether you\u2019ve got five minutes or five hours, there\u2019s always another fight waiting for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965610?t=1763305184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965610?t=1763305184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/d34dab49ce474e6fa188bd4b8485cfdf9e63ff22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763305184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/d34dab49ce474e6fa188bd4b8485cfdf9e63ff22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763305184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>BE PART OF THE MAYHEMVERSE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/212dcb712d0c8eb695f34ebba71ee76d.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/10f32f6db0a21ffe9c4088b6db6ef2bc.avif?t=1763305184\" width=350 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/722711c3ab123ad3f3c0a006f077a4f6.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickman Mayhem is a comic-styled fighting game where chaos rules the streets. With simple controls, flashy moves, and over-the-top action, you\u2019ll crush gangs, face ruthless bosses, and fight your way to become the ultimate stickman brawler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/5e078700a16c496af12ac5491e3738de.avif?t=1763305184\" width=538 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/918a5cce6df96abf4b578ed2261f324c.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a splash page of chaos.<strong> Punches crack, kicks smash, and finishers explode off the screen!</strong> Leap into <strong>Beatline</strong>, the climb-to-the-top rank mode where every step puts your skills to the test. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/0843e0f32dec91f93017d62a3174c142.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for <strong>Fistfall</strong>, an endless gauntlet of enemies that never stop coming. And when you\u2019re ready for the ultimate challenge, step into <strong>DeathZone</strong>, the brutal boss rush where you\u2019ll face back-to-back masters with no rest and no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/55288ae576cbf0a5cbb91895377d67d5.avif?t=1763305184\" width=538 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/53cca23c805b2bf8763d0314ae81cde7.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is packed with <strong>cinematic finishers</strong>, flashy counters, and that one sweet moment when your enemy falls in slow motion. Easy to pick up, tough to master and just the way a brawler should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/9c9b8c5f7fbb827fbd7d03a5347641dd.avif?t=1763305184\" width=480 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.poster.avif?t=1763305184\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.webm?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/extras/1fe4d78cf46bac9af10695f81994d73b.mp4?t=1763305184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickman Mayhem takes classic stickman action and cranks it to comic-book levels of madness. The streets are loud, the hits are heavy, and the mayhem never ends. Whether you\u2019ve got five minutes or five hours, there\u2019s always another fight waiting for you.</p>","developers":["BP Systems"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965610/05266d44b53acb195028adf33477a9aad4223414/header.jpg?t=1763305184","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Stickman Mayhem","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6 GB / Intel Arc A380 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum specs allow for 1080p 30FPS low s